     "texto": [
      "**公共汽车** is bus; **出租车**, taxi; **火车**, train; **飞机**, plane; **地铁**, subway. **站** is stop or station and **机场**, airport. **票** means ticket.",
      "**怎么** asks «how» and **出发**, «to leave» or «to set off»."
