     "titulo": "Going and getting there",
     "texto": [
      "**从** introduces the starting point and **到**, the destination or arrival. **等** means to wait. You can say **从家到学校** («from home to school»).",
      "In English we say «by bus», but in Chinese the vehicle comes after the verb 坐."
